OL,3,GNEWSAThe ecstasy of buying our first
OL,4,Ahome was short-lived after we found 150
OL,5,Afaults
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt was the day Georgina and Charles
OL,8,FBarnes had waited three years for, as
OL,9,Fthey picked up the keys to their first
OL,10,Fhome.
OL,12,FBut when the brand new property was
OL,13,Finspected days later by a Welsh
OL,14,Fsnagging company, the final quality
OL,15,Fcheck by independent inspectors, they
OL,16,Ffound 150 defects.
OL,18,FThese included incorrectly installed
OL,19,Ffire barriers, signs of a previous leak
OL,20,Fand what they called "exceptionally
OL,21,Fpoor" workmanship.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
