OL,3,GNEWSAThe ecstasy of buying our first
OL,4,Ahome was short-lived after we found 150
OL,5,Afaults
OL,6,
OL,7,FSwansea-based New Home Quality Control
OL,8,Fwas set up by John Cooper, who became
OL,9,Ffed up of being asked to hide things
OL,10,Ffrom customers on building sites.
